            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· 歸因:每個習慣各值幾年,附文獻依據"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 曲线:三情景资产轨迹与自由线": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Curves: asset trajectories and your freedom line"
