    "三情景结果与汇票永远免费。完整推演买断一次,永久可用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your three scenarios and the bill are free, forever. The full report is a single one-time purchase, yours for good."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三情境結果與匯票永遠免費。完整推演買斷一次,永久可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
